{"id":"0c503b9bc4320741","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-mathias-condition.md","title":"ZFC Mathias Condition","display":"df-zfc-mathias-condition — ZFC Mathias Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-mathias-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-mathias-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-mathias-condition — ZFC Mathias Condition","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-mathias-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-mathias-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-mathias-condition — ZFC Mathias Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6226ed6b29249a1a\" href=\"?note=6226ed6b29249a1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set\">58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,s,A,F\\in V\">\\(p,s,A,F\\in V\\)</span> (condition, finite stem, reservoir, and free filter)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\\)</span> (set-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6226ed6b29249a1a\" href=\"?note=6226ed6b29249a1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set\">58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mathias\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S(p,s,A,F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(\\omega,F)\\land\\forall u\\in[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(u\\notin F)\\land p=\\langle s,A\\rangle\\land s\\in[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land A\\in F\\land\\forall n\\in s\\;\\forall m\\in A\\;(n&lt;m)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mathias\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S(p,s,A,F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(\\omega,F)\\land\\forall u\\in[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(u\\notin F)\\land p=\\langle s,A\\rangle\\land s\\in[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land A\\in F\\land\\forall n\\in s\\;\\forall m\\in A\\;(n&lt;m)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The filter is free because it contains no finite subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>; the condition is an ordered-pair code with the finite stem strictly below its reservoir.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S$ (set-filter predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}$，其中 $\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]。 $[\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,s,A,F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"[\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mathias\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S(p,s,A,F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(\\omega,F)\\land\\forall u\\in[\\omega]^{<\\omega}\\;(u\\notin F)\\land p=\\langle s,A\\rangle\\land s\\in[\\omega]^{<\\omega}\\land A\\in F\\land\\forall n\\in s\\;\\forall m\\in A\\;(n<m)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1311,"backlinks":[{"id":"0138480e8111b6c9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p=(s,A),q=(t,B)$ (Mathias forcing conditions, see [[58-df-zfc-mathias-condition]])"},{"id":"52ebe7de18dba8af","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S$ (condition predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-mathias-condition.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2523","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-mathias-condition.md|58-df-zfc-mathias-condition]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["6226ed6b29249a1a","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}